  "summary": "In C17 the mask comes from comparing every target-day SST (2012-06-01..08-31) of every sea cell against threshold_smooth for doys 153-244. Those thresholds are 31-day wrapped means of the raw Hazen P90 for doys 138-259. Each of those raw values is pooled from \u00b15-day windows, so the baseline SST that reaches the mask is 13 May to 20 Sep of each year 1992-2002. The climatology is computed but not used in the mask."
